ンタルサーバーナレッジ","title_link":"https://knowledge.cpi.ad.jp/security-info/244/","text":"昨今この業界（IT/Web系）では、常時SSL化が話題になっていますが、常時SSLとは何？、SSL証明書とは何？と聞かれたときに上手く説明できますでしょうか。 当記事では、なぜ常時SSLが求められてい...","image_url":"https://knowledge.cpi.ad.jp/.assets/thumbnail/ssl-ogp-480wi-1200wi.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"レンタルサーバーナレッジ","service_icon":"https://knowledge.cpi.ad.jp/common/images/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://knowledge.cpi.ad.jp/security-info/244/","original_url":"https://knowledge.cpi.ad.jp/security-info/244/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dqT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"894e37f6-d25a-421f-98d5-8ed0161f7a0f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Let's Encrypt ：無料、正しく更新できないと 90 日で期限が切れる\n他証明書：有料、期限は最低1年、3年や5年でも買える","ts":"1624346570.139500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bTd7f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"918d75e4-43dd-4a36-9c85-2c8fb89cd0be","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"SIer 時代はもう少しお金積んでた気がするなぁ(人月単価高かった)。1人日(8時間)あたりで 5 万円くらいかなぁ。","ts":"1624346527.138800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6NOPu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9981964f-7cf4-4894-a730-55adeb0d5fe0","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"無料有料だとどっちの証明書が面倒なんでしたっけ","ts":"1624346456.137200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gr7nk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a46c486-f1f2-404b-9258-be43fdbb943c","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"切れる前に相談してほしい案件","ts":"1624346423.136400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=FH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a67a3318-ef0c-4922-9bca-d1fd7054417b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"1万とかかなー","ts":"1624346411.136000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qR2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c3a640a-cc41-460c-9965-6b547c888cf1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"IT 詳しくない友人から、企業(小規模)として公開している Web サイトの SSL の証明書の期限が切れてしまったので更新したい(前任者が更新のための資料を残してくれているけど前任者はもういない)って相談を受けたのだけど、これやるとしたらいくらくらいが相場なんですかね?\nと言うかやりたい人います?w","ts":"1624346306.135800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I962A"}]}]
